  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 0b8a015dee3c7904d89c21eb150f84c2, type: 3}
  m_Name: Dialog 12
  m_EditorClassIdentifier:
  chapterTitle: One Step at a Time
  steps:
  - rid: 8399111036994764401
  - rid: 253740709873489556
  - rid: 3660463620440864409
  - rid: 4005672747293624695
  - rid: 2566683320045321551
  - rid: 5359564630318242908
  - rid: 6480240493301468745
  - rid: 5858105115609950354
  - rid: 3841741708328889831
  - rid: 1780129654503495604
  references:
    version: 2
    RefIds:
    - rid: 8399111036994764401
      type: {class: MessageStep, ns: Watermelon, asm: Game.Scripts}
      data:
        character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: b0be64a9950f7b74e8fc6a7b3c511307, type: 2}
        emotion: 0
        text: I do not want to promise an event before I know I can finish everything.
    - rid: 253740709873489556
      type: {class: MessageStep, ns: Watermelon, asm: Game.Scripts}
      data:
        character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 6203bd20709b00b46a60b2afa30d49df, type: 2}
        emotion: 0
        text: Then do not promise the event.
    - rid: 3660463620440864409
      type: {class: MessageStep, ns: Watermelon, asm: Game.Scripts}
      data:
        character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 2757966820b1c56408bfbbd8d30dd10f, type: 2}
        emotion: 0
        text: Promise the next repair.
    - rid: 4005672747293624695
      type: {class: MessageStep, ns: Watermelon, asm: Game.Scripts}
      data:
        character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 524d737709eaff74c9db275b7ab92f00, type: 2}
        emotion: 0
        text: Then complete the one after that.
    - rid: 2566683320045321551
      type: {class: MessageStep, ns: Watermelon, asm: Game.Scripts}
      data:
        character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: ad4a74f0f2261874b962f568ba22424d, type: 2}
        emotion: 0
        text: And remember to occasionally drink the coffee rather than only selling
          it.
    - rid: 5359564630318242908
      type: {class: MessageStep, ns: Watermelon, asm: Game.Scripts}
      data:
        character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: b0be64a9950f7b74e8fc6a7b3c511307, type: 2}
        emotion: 0
        text: That sounds manageable.
    - rid: 6480240493301468745
      type: {class: MessageStep, ns: Watermelon, asm: Game.Scripts}
      data:
        character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 6203bd20709b00b46a60b2afa30d49df, type: 2}
        emotion: 0
        text: Most worthwhile things are manageable when you stop treating them
          as one enormous task.
    - rid: 5858105115609950354
      type: {class: MessageStep, ns: Watermelon, asm: Game.Scripts}
      data:
        character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: b0be64a9950f7b74e8fc6a7b3c511307, type: 2}
        emotion: 0
        text: One order, one repair.
    - rid: 3841741708328889831
      type: {class: MessageStep, ns: Watermelon, asm: Game.Scripts}
      data:
        character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 2757966820b1c56408bfbbd8d30dd10f, type: 2}
        emotion: 0
        text: And one unpaid coffee bill.
    - rid: 1780129654503495604
      type: {class: MessageStep, ns: Watermelon, asm: Game.Scripts}
      data:
        character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: b0be64a9950f7b74e8fc6a7b3c511307, type: 2}
        emotion: 0
        text: I have not forgotten.
